WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:36.930 --> 01:38.530
Mademoiselles,

01:38.530 --> 01:43.540
the midterm exam for becoming the Queen of the Magical World will begin.

01:44.070 --> 01:46.440
In this exam, the two of you, as Queen Candidates,

01:46.440 --> 01:50.180
will show me how much you have grown
after coming to the human world.

01:50.580 --> 01:52.280
What kind of exam is it?

01:52.650 --> 01:53.210
I don't know!

01:55.120 --> 01:57.320
The Magical Senate will give you an explanation.

02:02.060 --> 02:04.430
Well then, we will start explaining about the exam.

02:07.260 --> 02:10.260
Shining Heart! Queen Candidacy Exam

02:12.600 --> 02:14.120
Tomorrow, for the whole day,

02:14.120 --> 02:19.470
we shall see which of you can cause the most girls' hearts to shine.

02:20.540 --> 02:21.710
Girls?

02:22.210 --> 02:26.680
When you become a queen, to lead the
bulk of witches is an important part.

02:27.250 --> 02:30.550
Although you cannot acquire the hearts of girls,

02:30.550 --> 02:34.920
you can make their hearts shine with
respect, trust, and friendship.

02:35.520 --> 02:40.060
Only for tomorrow, you shall specially
collect rainbow-colored hearts.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.230
Rainbow-colored hearts...

02:42.700 --> 02:48.600
The one who can make the most girls'
hearts shine will pass the exam.

02:49.440 --> 02:51.610
Queen Candy, a word from you?

02:53.410 --> 02:57.950
Chocolat, Vanilla, you've worked hard thus far.

02:57.950 --> 02:59.780
It's finally your midterm exam.

03:00.420 --> 03:04.650
The results of this midterm exam
will have a big influence.

03:04.650 --> 03:06.750
So please try your best!

03:07.390 --> 03:08.020
Yes!

03:08.420 --> 03:11.490
I'm looking forward to it! The future queens.

03:14.030 --> 03:15.160
What is this?

03:15.560 --> 03:17.100
Please be quiet, you rat.

03:17.870 --> 03:20.770
I'm not a rat! I'm a mouse!

03:21.300 --> 03:23.170
You should bow your head.

03:23.170 --> 03:25.970
Besides, the way you keep saying
'chu-chu' is somewhat low-class.

03:27.610 --> 03:29.510
This fairy is kinda harsh.

03:29.510 --> 03:30.740
Who are you?

03:32.950 --> 03:35.580
I'm the exam investigator, Mont Blanc.

03:36.020 --> 03:40.490
I'm here to make sure there will
be no cheating in this exam.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.990
Does this mean she's going to be
here today and tomorrow too?

03:43.360 --> 03:47.830
Shall I ask the queen if I could change you
into a horned owl or something like that?

03:49.330 --> 03:51.010
Every bit of her is nasty!

03:51.700 --> 03:54.600
Come on, the both of you, give
me your heart holders.

03:56.000 --> 03:58.110
Vanilla, 45,000 ecure.

03:58.740 --> 04:00.270
Chocolat, 8,000 ecure.

04:01.210 --> 04:03.340
There seems to be a big difference.

04:03.650 --> 04:04.380
Chocolat.

04:05.310 --> 04:08.580
Chocolat-chan is always spending
hers on unnecessary things.

04:08.580 --> 04:10.180
Yup, that's right.

04:10.590 --> 04:14.660
No matter what, try and catch up in this exam.

04:16.190 --> 04:17.920
Vanilla, you should do your best too.

04:18.360 --> 04:19.090
Yes.

04:19.090 --> 04:23.460
Vanilla-chama, this is your chance to put an even bigger gap between you and Chocolat.

04:24.170 --> 04:25.700
I'm going to do my best!

04:26.100 --> 04:29.910
Even though you've put in all your energy,
you've always failed, haven't you, Chocolat?

04:30.290 --> 04:31.040
What?

04:31.940 --> 04:34.540
Until you get some results, you
can't fight back, can you?

04:38.480 --> 04:42.150
It's true that there's a big difference between
the hearts that I've collected and Vanilla's.

04:43.180 --> 04:45.820
Although Vanilla is popular in the human world,

04:45.820 --> 04:47.850
I'm not popular at all.

04:51.090 --> 04:54.230
At times like these,
if only I could read Mamas diary.

04:57.430 --> 04:59.100
I can't be pessimistic!

04:59.600 --> 05:01.470
I'll have to try hard in the midterm exam!

05:04.670 --> 05:05.770
What's wrong, Vanilla?

05:08.310 --> 05:08.780
What's that?

05:09.280 --> 05:10.810
Those are cookies!

05:10.810 --> 05:12.250
It failed.

05:12.780 --> 05:15.920
Why are you making cookies
in the middle of the night?

05:15.920 --> 05:19.250
I was thinking of passing them out
to the girls in our class tomorrow.

05:19.790 --> 05:24.190
I didn't know how else to make
girls' hearts shine, that's why...

05:24.890 --> 05:27.660
I thought I should do something
with my own abilities.

05:28.560 --> 05:31.130
You could've just used magic to do it.

05:33.030 --> 05:37.730
But if you really do it by yourself, it feels
like you've put your heart into it.

05:38.110 --> 05:39.090
Just recently,

05:39.090 --> 05:43.730
I sent a letter to Mama saying that I don't have as bright a personality as Chocolat-chan.

05:44.280 --> 05:48.450
If I can improve myself, then my personal
light will shine brighter!

05:48.880 --> 05:52.080
Is it okay to give your rival such a hint?

05:52.550 --> 05:56.020
But it's because of you, Chocolat-chan,
that I knew that!

05:58.660 --> 06:00.960
This kind of tenderness is just like Vanilla.

06:01.830 --> 06:04.060
What's just like me?

06:07.670 --> 06:14.310
What kind of girl would other girls
admire, or think "She's so cool!"?

06:15.310 --> 06:17.150
Beautiful and elegant,

06:17.150 --> 06:21.180
gentle and cool... a smart person, I suppose.

06:21.550 --> 06:26.790
Beautiful, elegant, gentle, cool and smart...

06:27.990 --> 06:29.660
Like Queen Candy!

06:30.690 --> 06:34.290
I suppose a queen would be popular among girls.

06:34.290 --> 06:35.790
Alright, me too!

06:37.370 --> 06:39.030
Chocolat, what's wrong?

06:39.600 --> 06:41.600
Nothing...why, nothing at all!

06:44.640 --> 06:46.740
That doesn't seem like Chocolat!

06:48.140 --> 06:51.650
Today I'm going to be like Queen Candy...no!

06:51.650 --> 06:55.220
I'll be as genteel as a queen.

06:57.290 --> 07:01.520
Hey, Kato. Don't laugh in that disgusting way.

07:01.520 --> 07:03.360
Seeing that makes me sick!

07:04.090 --> 07:05.460
Disgusting?

07:05.460 --> 07:07.360
What do you mean by "Ahohoho..."?

07:08.100 --> 07:09.860
I'll whup your butt!

07:11.970 --> 07:14.040
Now that's more like Chocolat.

07:14.040 --> 07:14.870
Really!

07:15.900 --> 07:17.870
This... is what I am...

07:19.440 --> 07:23.090
If I can improve myself, then my personal
light will shine brighter!

07:23.090 --> 07:27.010
I see! As long as I stay myself it'll be fine.

07:28.520 --> 07:33.620
Which means, I'll never be as elegant as a queen?!

07:34.220 --> 07:35.120
Here you go!

07:36.120 --> 07:37.620
What is this?

07:38.290 --> 07:42.600
As a token of thanks, I thought I'd give
out some homemade cookies.

07:42.990 --> 07:45.610
Eh, Vanilla-chan baked these!

07:45.930 --> 07:48.140
Vanilla-chan's homemade cookies!

07:48.140 --> 07:49.170
I want!

07:49.170 --> 07:51.570
Baking cookies is so girly.

07:51.570 --> 07:52.540
That's so great!

07:53.370 --> 07:57.240
Sorry, I baked these for the girls only.

07:57.880 --> 07:59.250
That's too bad...

07:59.550 --> 08:00.580
I'm giving them back.

08:01.520 --> 08:03.150
It's OK. Don't need them.

08:04.250 --> 08:09.120
Wait! Vanilla-chan tried so hard to perfect
the cookies until late at night yesterday!

08:09.120 --> 08:11.090
She was hoping you guys
would enjoy them.

08:12.030 --> 08:13.660
Go ahead and give 'em to the boys.

08:13.660 --> 08:15.430
We're fine with it.

08:16.260 --> 08:17.200
Vanilla.

08:17.830 --> 08:20.200
Then I'll just eat them all!

08:23.200 --> 08:23.900
Vanilla!

08:27.280 --> 08:30.650
Vanilla-chama, let's think of another idea.

08:30.650 --> 08:32.880
The exam has just started.

08:33.480 --> 08:34.050
Vanilla.

08:35.680 --> 08:36.410
Are you alright?

08:44.130 --> 08:46.960
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

08:51.830 --> 08:52.630
Wand!

09:03.640 --> 09:05.920
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

09:06.350 --> 09:09.680
Delicious tea that goes with cookies! Appear!

09:19.490 --> 09:20.630
Chocolat-chan!

09:23.800 --> 09:25.200
These are delicious, Vaniilla.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.370
Thanks, Chocolat-chan.

09:29.870 --> 09:33.370
They're so delicious, yet what
everyone did was horrible.

09:34.080 --> 09:34.770
It's OK.

09:36.240 --> 09:37.640
I'ts not their fault.

09:38.780 --> 09:41.410
I'll try again.

09:43.320 --> 09:44.180
Vanilla.

09:45.250 --> 09:49.090
Don't worry about me. Chocolat-chan
should work hard too.

09:50.560 --> 09:55.860
Said as it is. If you dilly-dally, the day will end soon.

09:56.430 --> 10:00.170
That's right! Let's make up for the difference
between your and Vanilla's collected hearts!

10:04.770 --> 10:07.970
It's true that I shouldn't be worrying about Vanilla.

10:08.840 --> 10:11.980
I'm not Vanilla or Queen Candy.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.010
Kato-san.

10:13.010 --> 10:13.910
Then...

10:14.580 --> 10:15.450
Kato-san.

10:16.880 --> 10:18.720
Continue reading from where we left off.

10:19.150 --> 10:21.560
I'm sorry! I was thinking about something else!

10:21.560 --> 10:24.260
In the middle of a class, please think
about what's being taught.

10:25.130 --> 10:26.060
Yes!

10:27.860 --> 10:31.330
Chocolat! Look with your peek-a-boo glasses.

10:32.030 --> 10:33.330
Peek-a-boo glasses?

10:35.070 --> 10:36.340
Ah, rainbow-colored hearts!

10:36.770 --> 10:41.940
Rainbow hearts will come out if they think
something is funny or interesting.

10:41.940 --> 10:42.880
Is that so?

10:45.650 --> 10:49.020
But what should I do to make it more fun for them?

10:50.050 --> 10:51.950
What would be more fun for me would be...

10:53.150 --> 10:54.050
That's right!

10:55.090 --> 10:55.990
Kato-san.

10:56.420 --> 10:58.060
What is it this time?

10:58.060 --> 10:59.750
S... sorry!

11:02.430 --> 11:06.770
A rainbow heart is 500 ecure.

11:02.730 --> 11:04.630
Everyone! Please quiet down!

11:07.130 --> 11:10.480
At a glance, there's about 5,000 ecure.

11:10.910 --> 11:13.970
For once, you're getting a head start at this!

11:13.970 --> 11:14.730
Really?

11:15.140 --> 11:16.080
Do your best!

11:16.440 --> 11:18.010
Yeah! I'm on it!

11:35.900 --> 11:36.900
Alright!

11:37.900 --> 11:40.530
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

11:42.080 --> 11:43.740
Invitation tickets!

11:43.740 --> 11:44.570
Come out!

11:50.280 --> 11:51.610
What is this?

11:51.950 --> 11:55.810
Ta-da! This is the invitation tickets
to the Sugar Rune festival.

11:56.380 --> 11:57.620
Sugar Rune festival?

11:58.090 --> 12:01.420
There's going to be a festival at the
porch of my house, for girls only!

12:02.990 --> 12:05.090
I don't really know what that is,
but it sounds interesting!

12:05.090 --> 12:07.590
I've always wanted to visit Chocolat's house!

12:08.090 --> 12:09.460
Invite everyone, ok?

12:09.860 --> 12:11.030
What is it?

12:11.030 --> 12:12.080
I want to go too!

12:12.300 --> 12:14.530
Everyone's welcome!

12:17.040 --> 12:19.180
What are you guys doing at this place?

12:20.470 --> 12:21.670
Er, that...

12:24.280 --> 12:26.250
Sugar Rune festival?

12:26.250 --> 12:27.450
What is this?

12:28.100 --> 12:28.750
A festival.

12:29.280 --> 12:30.360
Only for girls.

12:31.890 --> 12:34.190
Then that means we can join too, right?

12:34.520 --> 12:34.900
Eh?

12:35.290 --> 12:38.230
Because we're girls too.

12:38.230 --> 12:38.940
That's right!

12:40.760 --> 12:42.830
No problem. You can come if you want.

12:43.930 --> 12:45.630
Then I'll visit you later.

12:48.070 --> 12:54.810
Members are girls too. I'll make sure it's fun
enough to make their hearts shine too!

13:02.480 --> 13:05.850
The festivals back in the magical world were so fun!

13:09.120 --> 13:11.060
Alright, I'll do my best!

13:12.890 --> 13:17.900
Ah...what should I do? Is it too late?

13:18.230 --> 13:21.470
You can't be pessimistic, Vanilla-chama!

13:23.170 --> 13:24.030
Eh, what is it?

13:24.870 --> 13:26.070
What's with everyone?

13:26.540 --> 13:28.070
It's the Sugar Rune Festival.

13:28.580 --> 13:30.410
Sugar Rune festival?

13:30.410 --> 13:32.310
Chocolat said for everyone to come!

13:35.080 --> 13:36.000
Welcome!

13:36.000 --> 13:38.320
Pardon us!

13:38.320 --> 13:39.320
Chocolat-chan.

13:39.320 --> 13:41.760
Ah...Vanilla! Welcome home!

13:42.090 --> 13:44.230
Um, the Sugar Rune festival is...?

13:44.230 --> 13:46.360
Ah...that's so awesome!

13:45.790 --> 13:47.360
What a cute room!

13:47.360 --> 13:49.800
The festival is outside. This way!

13:50.430 --> 13:51.760
Ah, Chocolat-chan!

13:56.700 --> 14:00.640
Ta-da! Welcome to the Sugar Rune festival!

14:03.480 --> 14:04.950
What is this?

14:04.250 --> 14:04.950
It's scary!

14:04.950 --> 14:06.280
Isn't this a haunted house?

14:07.410 --> 14:07.910
Eh?

14:08.250 --> 14:14.050
Chocolat-chan! Everyone'll be scared
like this! Let's make it into a cute festival.

14:14.050 --> 14:17.560
Vanilla-chama, why are you giving her advice?

14:17.990 --> 14:20.990
I'll have everyone wait in the room.

14:22.100 --> 14:24.800
Everyone, please have some tea in the living room.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.370
Vanilla! Thanks!

14:26.700 --> 14:28.340
Alright then, while there's time!

14:29.170 --> 14:31.670
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

14:33.340 --> 14:34.870
Ah, what a shock!

14:35.510 --> 14:39.190
Did Chocolat intend to scare us?

14:39.580 --> 14:42.680
She did say that it's a festival only for girls.

14:44.690 --> 14:45.790
Ah, just wait a moment.

14:46.290 --> 14:48.150
The design is being changed.

14:48.760 --> 14:50.390
Vanilla! It's alright now.

14:55.260 --> 14:58.580
Welcome to the Sugar Rune Festival!

15:00.970 --> 15:01.870
What is this?

15:14.880 --> 15:17.120
What is this childish thing?

15:17.620 --> 15:19.430
But it's so cute!

15:20.820 --> 15:22.860
Welcome to the Sugar Rune festival!

15:23.290 --> 15:24.890
Everyone, please enjoy!

15:27.760 --> 15:28.930
Welcome!

15:30.030 --> 15:32.130
My divination is very accurate!

15:34.030 --> 15:36.340
Your lucky color is yellow.

15:36.340 --> 15:38.750
When going out on dates, wear yellow clothes!

15:38.750 --> 15:41.810
That's so cool! How does it move?

15:41.810 --> 15:43.340
Me? Me?

15:48.380 --> 15:51.150
Luck rate: Pink heart?

15:51.150 --> 15:53.150
It says I'm "pee."

15:53.150 --> 15:53.890
Pee?

16:02.700 --> 16:05.030
Chocolat-chan, everyone's enjoying themselves.

16:05.630 --> 16:08.030
There'll be a lot of rainbow colored hearts!

16:08.540 --> 16:10.400
Chocolat-chan is really great!

16:12.410 --> 16:13.640
No such thing!

16:14.310 --> 16:16.540
It's thanks to Vanilla's advice.

16:17.040 --> 16:21.000
That's right! Vanilla, make your marvelous dessert!

16:25.750 --> 16:31.360
Hear, hear! This is Vanilla's Cafe Corner!
Freshly baked pancakes!

16:32.390 --> 16:33.460
Smells great!

16:33.460 --> 16:34.460
Let's get some!

16:34.860 --> 16:35.660
Shall we go?

16:38.030 --> 16:38.930
Here you go!

16:40.400 --> 16:41.570
Bon appetite!

16:44.310 --> 16:46.480
- So soft!
- Yummy!

16:46.940 --> 16:48.910
I'm so glad you like it!

16:49.580 --> 16:52.110
Vanilla's homemade desserts
are delicious, aren't they?

16:52.410 --> 16:55.380
The cookies from earlier were
for everyone, too.

16:57.520 --> 16:59.720
Sorry about earlier, Vanilla-chan.

16:59.720 --> 17:01.080
We said such mean things.

17:03.260 --> 17:06.630
Don't worry about it! Help yourself!

17:10.030 --> 17:15.840
Over here! This is Vanilla's Cafe Corner!
Help yourself to fresh pancakes!

17:27.650 --> 17:31.790
500 ecure... 1000 ecure... 1500 ecure...

17:31.790 --> 17:32.990
Here.

17:32.990 --> 17:33.610
Hmm?

17:33.920 --> 17:36.760
One of Vanilla's homemade pancakes!

17:36.760 --> 17:38.490
My, how thoughtful.

17:38.790 --> 17:44.000
Um, why don't you give 5000 ecure
to Vanilla-chama as a bonus?

17:44.300 --> 17:46.800
No way, you self-serving rat.

17:47.370 --> 17:49.200
You stingy witch!

17:54.710 --> 17:57.110
Ah, the exam's over.

17:58.250 --> 18:00.150
I failed completely, though.

18:00.880 --> 18:01.950
But it was fun!

18:02.720 --> 18:04.200
Thanks to Chocolat-chan!

18:05.890 --> 18:06.650
Vanilla.

18:08.890 --> 18:10.590
The exam ends here.

18:10.990 --> 18:13.150
Please proceed to the Magical World.

18:19.970 --> 18:21.770
Let's go, Vanilla!

18:23.400 --> 18:25.740
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:28.610 --> 18:30.710
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

18:33.410 --> 18:35.390
Open the door of the moon!

18:49.700 --> 18:52.170
Now we can fly properly in the Magical World.

18:52.970 --> 18:54.200
It feels good!

18:54.700 --> 18:56.100
Wait! Chocolat-chan!

19:11.520 --> 19:14.450
Then let's announce the results of the exam.

19:16.520 --> 19:19.360
Vanilla: 3,500 ecure.

19:19.990 --> 19:23.140
Chocolat: 25,000 ecure.

19:25.730 --> 19:29.170
These results are the third best in history.

19:30.000 --> 19:33.380
Because of Chocolat Meilleure's excellent results,

19:33.380 --> 19:36.650
the queen will present you with a special souvenir.

19:37.010 --> 19:38.210
Chocolat, come forward.

19:38.780 --> 19:39.410
Yes!

19:43.480 --> 19:44.920
Congratulations, Chocolat!

19:45.520 --> 19:46.950
You tried your best, didn't you?

19:47.820 --> 19:49.420
I present you with this.

19:51.490 --> 19:56.100
With that, you can fly freely in the human world.

19:56.100 --> 19:57.530
Thank you very much!

19:57.870 --> 20:01.330
But the exam is not over yet.

20:01.740 --> 20:05.260
Both of you should work hard from now on, too.

20:05.610 --> 20:06.070
Yes!

20:12.380 --> 20:14.020
Congratulations, Chocolat-chan!

20:14.880 --> 20:17.680
It's all thanks to you, Vanilla!

20:18.450 --> 20:19.730
I'm going to try my best too!

20:21.690 --> 20:24.890
Chocolat! Yoo-hoo!

20:25.290 --> 20:26.870
Houx! Saule!

20:27.430 --> 20:29.900
You got very good grades in the midterm exam?

20:30.300 --> 20:31.000
Congratulations!

20:31.470 --> 20:32.170
Thank you!

20:32.770 --> 20:33.830
Are you going back now?

20:34.400 --> 20:37.460
Yeah. The human world is very fun too!

20:39.470 --> 20:44.010
Even though I wasn't used to it
at first, I've made new friends.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.810
We're going to miss you.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.480
Chocolat seems to be so far away.

20:49.220 --> 20:50.280
Don't say that!

20:51.080 --> 20:52.490
I'll be coming back soon!

20:54.020 --> 20:56.130
Houx! Saule! See you again!

20:56.460 --> 20:57.220
Bye bye!

20:58.090 --> 21:00.960
Try your best! Chocolat! Vanilla!

21:00.960 --> 21:01.960
See you again!

21:21.320 --> 21:25.920
That is Pierre. Why is he in the Magical World?

21:26.590 --> 21:28.150
What's wrong, Chocolat-chan?

21:29.220 --> 21:30.660
Nope, it's nothing.

21:31.790 --> 21:33.490
It must be a mistake!

21:40.370 --> 21:42.740
It's so convenient with a broom!

21:43.670 --> 21:45.910
But this is somewhat shabby.

21:50.710 --> 21:52.220
What is this?!

21:54.720 --> 21:58.480
Got it! Got it! I won't say you're shabby anymore.

22:00.520 --> 22:01.750
That was scary!

22:02.820 --> 22:04.760
Somehow the midterm exam is over!

22:08.720 --> 22:11.450
I'll work hard to collect more hearts, Mama.

22:23.180 --> 22:29.480
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.610 --> 22:30.980
"Love"

22:31.900 --> 22:35.400
A magic spell.

22:37.570 --> 22:44.840
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.270 --> 22:54.350
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.020 --> 23:00.290
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.890 --> 23:03.960
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.260 --> 23:11.330
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.700 --> 23:16.140
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.140 --> 23:26.250
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.310 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.130 --> 23:48.620
Houx and Saule came from the Magical World.

23:49.220 --> 23:52.660
They transferred to our Middle School but...

23:52.660 --> 23:53.870
Are they going to be alright?

23:54.640 --> 23:56.150
Coming in from the window...

23:56.150 --> 23:57.440
Using magic...

23:57.440 --> 24:00.030
On top of that, a tennis match with Pierre?

24:00.860 --> 24:04.460
There's no choice. I'll become a cheerleader to support them!

24:05.840 --> 24:08.160
Next on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.160 --> 24:10.160
The Magician Transfer Students.

24:10.980 --> 24:12.980
If you don't watch it, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.980 --> 24:13.880
Thanks!
